+  - id: browser-reference-container
+    name: Browser tests in a pinned reference container
+    kind: tool
+    tools: [Docker, Playwright container image]
+    purpose: "The browser suite and its screenshot baselines run in one pinned Linux container on every host, so a Mac and a CI runner render identical pixels (A-17)."
