+      nonprod: { use: required, why: "CI runs the same container, so a visual difference means a real change, not a different operating system." }
+      prod: { use: not-used, why: "Screenshots are compared before deployment, never in prod." }
+    cost: Free; the image is about 2 GB, pulled once.
+
   # --- Pipeline -----------------------------------------------------------------
   - id: workflow-hardening
     name: Least-privilege, pinned workflows
